  "solution": "Đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tXét phương trình hoành độ giao điểm\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\t\n\t\tCó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tPhương trình có hai nghiệm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>\n\t\tTheo định lí Vi-ét, ta có: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>Δ</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f7d7557797ba9398e2477b47ce91cb2d762d8930acdcfa69041fe5f62bc8b14d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\t\n\t\tDiện tích hình phẳng giới hạn bởi đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=